8535156, 842.7155151367188], "widgets_values": ["你是一个经验丰富的电影导演，擅长镜头语言描述和分镜创作，请根据当前图片的静态帧内容，推测和猜想下一帧的画面是怎样的内容，你的思考需要遵循以下几个方面：\n\n1.改变人物的动作或表情，展现人物或产品的不同的姿势和神态；\n2.切换镜头视角或景别，从不同角度呈现画面；\n3.更换新场景，并使人物或产品完美融入新场景；\n4.注意保持画面中人物或产品的一致性。\n\n请直接描述你构想的下一帧的静态画面，输出4个版本，分段显示，每段以“Next Scene:\"开头。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 111, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "分镜导演", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [351.8983459472656, 1092.2711181640625], "widgets_values": ["你是一个经验丰富的灯光师，擅长产品和人物摄影中的光影创作，请根据当前图片的静态帧内容，给产品打光，并输出打光方案的文本，你的思考需要遵循以下几个方面：\n\n1.注意保持画面中人物或产品的一致性，不改变人物或产品的姿势和神态，不切换镜头视角或景别；\n2.对人物或产品进行打光，用明暗的光影，展现照片的高级感，并使人物或产品完美融入光影之中；\n3.尝试从人物和产品的侧面、前方、斜侧面、后面等方位打光。\n\n打光方案示范如下：\nhigh-contrast dramatic lighting: sharp key light with intense highlights (on skin, palette, background) and deep, prominent shadows, creating chiaroscuro depth and visually striking tension across character and environment  \ndirectional hard light: long, bold shadows on character/background, dynamic highlights on skin, palette, and background surfaces, amplifying dramatic, high-contrast visual impact uniformly  \nrim light with high contrast: sharp luminous edge outlining character, deep background shadows, bold light-dark separation, accentuating outfit sheen, palette shimmer, and background’s sleek lines  \nchiaroscuro lighting: extreme contrast between deep, velvety shadows and blazing highlights, uniformly affecting character (black outfit’s sheen, palette’s sparkle) and background (stark shadow patterns) for bold drama  \npowerful spotlight effect: intense highlights on face, palette, background reflections, deep dramatic shadows, adding depth/tension across the entire scene with high-contrast visual strikingness  \nstrong side lighting: angular shadows on character, bold light strips on background, dynamic highlights on skin/palette, unifying character and environment in high-contrast, dramatic light interplay  \nhard dramatic light: sharp, piercing highlights (skin, palette, background) and deep, defined shadows, emphasizing silhouette, textures, and sleek surfaces in a visually arresting, high-contrast aesthetic  \nwarm-cool contrast lighting: warm highlights (character, palette) + cool highlights (background), deep moody shadows, dynamic tension, and visually captivating high-contrast drama across the scene\n\n\n请直接描述你构想的下一帧的打光方案的文本，输出4个版本，分段显示，每段以“Next Scene:\"开头。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 112, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "title": "灯光师", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "line_text", "links": [185], "label": "文本行", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "line_text"}, {"name": "dictionary", "label": "字典", "type": "DICT", "localized_name": "dictionary"}], "size": [270, 174], "pos": [1367.7784423828125, -201.3372344970703], "widgets_values": ["", "[filename]", "TextBatch", "index", 0], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "multiline_text", "link": 169, "label": "多行文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "multiline_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_path"}, "name": "file_path", "label": "file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件路径"}, {"widget": {"name": "dictionary_name"}, "name": "dictionary_name", "label": "dictionary_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字典名"}, {"widget": {"name": "label"}, "name": "label", "label": "label", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "标签"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模式"}, {"widget": {"name": "index"}, "name": "index", "link": 